      "title": "Livewire: Fix use-after-free error",
      "message": "Livewire: Fix use-after-free error\n\nSending the same HWID for a node or PSID for a source twice in the same\nmessage would result in a use-after-free on the data in the tree. Check\nto make sure we're not about to free the data we just pulled from the\ntree.\n\nFixes #21393\n",
      "author_name": "Dennis Graiani",
      "author_email": "dennis.graiani@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-07-05T23:29:42.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "Dennis Graiani",
